"<div><div class="flex flex-row w-full h-[calc(100%-50px)] overflow-y-hidden"><div class="overflow-auto w-full"><div class="relative float-right"><button type="button" id="report-menu-button" aria-haspopup="true" aria-label="Report menu" class="p-2 m-1 rounded-full text-neutral-300 hover:bg-white/10"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 8c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2s-.9-2-2-2-2 .9-2 2 .9 2 2 2m0 2c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2s.9 2 2 2 2-.9 2-2-.9-2-2-2m0 6c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2s.9 2 2 2 2-.9 2-2-.9-2-2-2"></path></svg></button></div><div class="h-[10px]"></div><div class="flex flex-row overflow-x-scroll px-12 gap-12 w-full hide-scrollbar"><div class="ml-auto "><div class="flex flex-col items-center py-6 px-10 bg-dark-charcoal border border-gray-800 rounded-lg w-[500px] shrink-0"><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-2"><div class="bg-theme-color rounded-full min-w-[12px] w-[12px] min-h-[12px]"></div><div class="text-neutral-300 text-center line-clamp-1">RN0720RC1_true_thousandtexts (com.rn0720rc1_true_thousandtexts)</div></div><div class="h-8"></div><svg width="152" height="152" viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none"><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="90" stroke="white" stroke-opacity="0.1" stroke-width="20"></circle><path d="M 94.34885324236181 189.82240555854446 A 90 90 0 1 0 100 10" stroke-width="20" class="stroke-warning"></path><text x="100" y="100" dominant-baseline="central" text-anchor="middle" aria-label="Score" class="text-center text-6xl font-semibold fill-white">51</text></svg><div class="h-8"></div><div class="w-full border rounded-lg border-gray-800"><div class="px-6 py-4  cursor-pointer"><div class="flex flex-row w-full items-center"><div class="flex-1"><div class="flex flex-row"><div class="text-neutral-300">Average Test Runtime</div><div class="grow"></div><div class="text-neutral-300 whitespace-pre">401 ms</div><div class="w-2"></div></div></div><svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="rotate-0 transition-transform ease-linear"><path class="stroke-white" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="m8.5 10 4 4 4-4"></path></svg></div><div class="cursor-default overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300" style="height: 0px;"><div class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">Time taken to run the test.<br>Can be helpful to measure Time To Interactive of your app, if the test is checking app start for instance.</div><div class="h-2"></div><div class="text-neutral-400 text-sm"><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Min Max Range: <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">275.2 ms to 526 ms</span></div><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Standard deviation range : <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">275.2 ms to 526 ms</span></div><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Coefficient of variation : <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">31.3 %</span></div><div class="h-2"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="h-2"></div><div class="w-full border rounded-lg border-gray-800"><div class="px-6 py-4  cursor-pointer"><div class="flex flex-row w-full items-center"><div class="flex-1"><div class="flex flex-row"><div class="text-neutral-300">Average FPS</div><div class="grow"></div><div class="text-neutral-300 whitespace-pre">45.3 FPS</div><div class="w-2"></div></div></div><svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="rotate-0 transition-transform ease-linear"><path class="stroke-white" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="m8.5 10 4 4 4-4"></path></svg></div><div class="cursor-default overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300" style="height: 0px;"><div class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">Frame Per Second. Your app should display 60 Frames Per Second to give an impression of fluidity. This number should be close to 60, otherwise it will seem laggy. <br>See <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CaMTIgxCSqU" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">this video</a> for more details</div><div class="h-2"></div><div class="text-neutral-400 text-sm"><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Min Max Range: <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">43.2 FPS to 47.4 FPS</span></div><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Standard deviation range : <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">43.2 FPS to 47.4 FPS</span></div><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Coefficient of variation : <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">4.7 %</span></div><div class="h-2"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="h-2"></div><div class="w-full border rounded-lg border-gray-800"><div class="px-6 py-4  cursor-pointer"><div class="flex flex-row w-full items-center"><div class="flex-1"><div class="flex flex-row"><div class="text-neutral-300">Average CPU usage</div><div class="grow"></div><div class="text-neutral-300 whitespace-pre">79.9 %</div><div class="w-2"></div></div></div><svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="rotate-0 transition-transform ease-linear"><path class="stroke-white" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="m8.5 10 4 4 4-4"></path></svg></div><div class="cursor-default overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300" style="height: 0px;"><div class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">An app might run at high frame rates, such as 60 FPS or higher, but might be using too much processing power, so it's important to check CPU usage.<br> Depending on the device, this value can go up to <code>100% × number of cores</code> (400% on a 4-core device). On iOS the profiler reports the whole process, so it is not broken down per thread.</div><div class="h-2"></div><div class="text-neutral-400 text-sm"><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Min Max Range: <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">69.5 % to 90.2 %</span></div><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Standard deviation range : <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">69.5 % to 90.2 %</span></div><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Coefficient of variation : <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">12.9 %</span></div><div class="h-2"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="h-2"></div><div class="w-full border rounded-lg border-gray-800"><div class="px-6 py-4  cursor-pointer"><div class="flex flex-row w-full items-center"><div class="flex-1"><div class="flex flex-row"><div class="text-neutral-300">High CPU Usage</div><div class="grow"></div><div class="text-neutral-300 whitespace-pre"><div style="color: red;">4 s</div></div><div class="w-2"></div></div></div><svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="rotate-0 transition-transform ease-linear"><path class="stroke-white" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="m8.5 10 4 4 4-4"></path></svg></div><div class="cursor-default overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300" style="height: 0px;"><div class="text-neutral-400 text-sm"><div class="mb-2"><p>Impacted threads:</p><p class="whitespace-pre">- RN JS Thread for 2.3s</p><p class="whitespace-pre">- UI Thread for 1.8s</p></div>High CPU usage by a single process can cause app unresponsiveness, even with low overall CPU usage. For instance, an overworked JS thread in a React Native app may lead to unresponsiveness despite maintaining 60 FPS.</div><div class="h-2"></div><div class="text-neutral-400 text-sm"><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Min Max Range: <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">3500 ms to 4500 ms</span></div><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Standard deviation range : <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">3500 ms to 4500 ms</span></div><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Coefficient of variation : <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">12.5 %</span></div><div class="h-2"></div> <div class="flex flex-col"><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">- RN JS Thread -<div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Min Max Range: <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">2000 ms to 2500 ms</span></div><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Standard deviation range : <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">2000 ms to 2500 ms</span></div><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Coefficient of variation : <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">11.1 %</span></div><div class="h-2"></div></div><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">- UI Thread -<div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Min Max Range: <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">1500 ms to 2000 ms</span></div><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Standard deviation range : <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">1500 ms to 2000 ms</span></div><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Coefficient of variation : <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">14.3 %</span></div><div class="h-2"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="h-2"></div><div class="w-full border rounded-lg border-gray-800"><div class="px-6 py-4  cursor-pointer"><div class="flex flex-row w-full items-center"><div class="flex-1"><div class="flex flex-row"><div class="text-neutral-300">Average RAM usage</div><div class="grow"></div><div class="text-neutral-300 whitespace-pre">108.7 MB</div><div class="w-2"></div></div></div><svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="rotate-0 transition-transform ease-linear"><path class="stroke-white" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="m8.5 10 4 4 4-4"></path></svg></div><div class="cursor-default overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300" style="height: 0px;"><div class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">If an app consumes a large amount of RAM (random-access memory), it can impact the overall performance of the device and drain the battery more quickly.<br>It's worth noting that results might be higher than expected: on Android we measure RSS (not PSS), so memory shared with other processes is counted in full. On iOS the value is the process's physical footprint, as reported by the system monitor.</div><div class="h-2"></div><div class="text-neutral-400 text-sm"><div class="text-neutral-300 text-sm">Min Max Range: <span class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">107.2 MB to 